    "description": "Continuously recorded velocimeter data for observatory stations at Crozet (CRZF), Kerguelen (PAF), Amsterdam Island (AIS), and Dumont d'Urville (DRV).\n\nData is provided in SEED format by the IRIS and Geoscope data centers.  \n\nData availability:\nPAF : 1984, 1986 to present\nCRZF: 1986 to present\nDRV : 1986 to present\nAIS : 1994 to present\n\nNB: Efforts to include older data are in progress.  Metadata will be updated as older data becomes available.",
